---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Projects
description: Side projects by Jimmy Chen and what each one taught, from tooling that connects AI agents to an accounting ledger to an open-source workflow for coding agents.
permalink: /projects/
---
<section class="wrap page">
  <header class="page__head">
    {% include "art/projects.njk" %}
    <p class="eyebrow">On the side</p>
    <h1>What I build around the ledger.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Accounting comes first. These are the things I've built alongside it, and what each one taught me.</p>
  </header>
  <div class="page__body">
    {%- for project in projects %}
    <article class="project" id="{{ project.id }}">
      <div class="project__side">
        <p class="eyebrow">{{ project.kind }}</p>
        <h2>{{ project.name }}</h2>
        {%- if project.link %}
        <p><a class="more" href="{{ project.link.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ project.link.label }}</a></p>
        {%- endif %}
      </div>
      <div class="project__body">
        <p class="project__summary">{{ project.summary }}</p>
        <p class="project__insight">{{ project.insight }}</p>
        {%- for paragraph in project.body %}
        <p>{{ paragraph }}</p>
        {%- endfor %}
        <h3>What I took from it</h3>
        <ul>
          {%- for lesson in project.lessons %}
          <li>{{ lesson }}</li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </article>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
